	"menu.roll_call_in_progress": "The clerks are still counting the ballots in Senayan. Wait for the tally, or press SKIP TO FINAL COUNT.",
	"military.anger.note": "Climbs every turn, and climbs faster when you anger them again. Other factions give you [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$RES$%[/color][/b] less from deals, decrees, actions and events (at most [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$MAX$%[/color][/b]), and your [b][color=__STAT_PC__]Political Capital[/color][/b] income is cut by the same amount. Reconciliation with the military occurs [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$STUB$%[/color][/b] more slowly. Meeting with them eases it a little, and a warm relationship stops it climbing and slowly bleeds it away.",
	"military.anger.note_zero": "Climbs every turn, and climbs faster when you anger them again. On this difficulty it does not weaken your other dealings, but the generals warm to you [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$STUB$%[/color][/b] more slowly. Meeting them eases it a little, and a warm relationship (TNI loyalty above 55) bleeds it away.",
	"military.anger.title": "The Military's Anger",
	"military.blunted": "Military interference blunted this deal ($RES$%).",
	"military.patience.note": "Wears down every turn when the generals are ignored. Meeting with them holds it, and anything that angers them burns it faster. At zero it turns to [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]anger[/color][/b], and anger can cost you up to [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$MAX$%[/color][/b] of what other factions give you, and of your [b][color=__STAT_PC__]Political Capital[/color][/b] income.",
	"military.patience.note_zero": "Wears down every turn the generals are ignored; meeting them holds it, and anything that angers them burns it faster. At zero it turns to [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]anger[/color][/b]. On this difficulty the anger will not weaken your other dealings, but the generals will be slow to forgive.",
	"military.patience.title": "The Military's Patience",
	"military.resist_line": "[b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]The military's interference cuts what this faction gives you by $RES$%.[/color][/b]",
	"military.status.line": "Military interference cuts your gains by $RES$%.",
