	"parliament.hover_default": "Hover or tap any seat block or legend item to inspect caucus strength. Click to initiate negotiations.",
	"parliament.info_desktop": "[b]$NAME$[/b] | $SEATS$ Delegates | Disposition: $MOOD$",
	"parliament.info_mobile": "[b]$NAME$[/b] ($SEATS$ Seats) | $MOOD$ | $BUTTON$",
	"parliament.legend_click": "Click to interact with $NAME$",
	"parliament.legend_dissolved": "$NAME$ | Dissolved",
	"parliament.negotiate": "Negotiate",
	"parliament.rostrum": "MPR ROSTRUM",
	"parliament.seat_title": "$NAME$ ($SEATS$ Delegates) | $MOOD$",
	"pdip.note.0": "The red shirts wait on Kebagusan. Mobilization climbs every turn you do not deal with PDI Perjuangan, and climbs faster the more hostile Megawati's camp is; winning them over eases it. Each time it passes [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]25%[/color][/b], [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]50%[/color][/b], [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]75%[/color][/b] and [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]100%[/color][/b] the street demands more loudly that Habibie must go: [b][color=__STAT_PC__]Political Capital[/color][/b], [b][color=__STAT_POP__]Popularity[/color][/b] and [b][color=__STAT_REF__]Reformasi Credibility[/color][/b] gains [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]shrink[/color][/b], PDI Perjuangan grows [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]harder to win and costlier to talk to[/color][/b], and at [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]100%[/color][/b] they [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]vote to reject to the last delegate[/color][/b].",
	"pdip.note.4": "Total mobilization. Gains of [b][color=__STAT_PC__]Political Capital[/color][/b], [b][color=__STAT_POP__]Popularity[/color][/b] and [b][color=__STAT_REF__]Reformasi Credibility[/color][/b] are cut by [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$CUT$%[/color][/b], PDI Perjuangan's negotiators charge [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]×$MULT$[/color][/b], and the bloc will [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]vote to reject to the last delegate[/color][/b], with no defection and no abstention.",
	"pdip.note.n": "Habibie must go, says the street. Riding on a wave of the Spirit of Reformasi, Megawati's redshirts take to the streets. Gains of [b][color=__STAT_PC__]Political Capital[/color][/b], [b][color=__STAT_POP__]Popularity[/color][/b] and [b][color=__STAT_REF__]Reformasi Credibility[/color][/b] are cut by [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$CUT$%[/color][/b], PDI Perjuangan warms to you [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$MG$%[/color][/b] more slowly and votes [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]$ADJ$[/color][/b] points against you on the floor, and its negotiators now charge [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]×$MULT$[/color][/b]. At [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]100%[/color][/b] the bloc votes to [b][color=__CLR_DARK_RED__]reject to the last delegate.[/color][/b]",
	"pdip.tier.0.label": "Standing Down",
	"pdip.tier.1.label": "Guarded Watchfulness",
	"pdip.tier.2.label": "Simmering Unrest",
	"pdip.tier.3.label": "Mass Mobilization",
	"pdip.tier.4.label": "Active Riots",
	"pdip.tier_line": "Tier $T$ of 4: $LABEL$",
	"pdip.title": "Street Mobilization",
