loading_messages = PackedStringArray("Investigating Bank Bali cessie transfers...", "Auditing BLBI liquidity support ledgers...", "Establishing encrypted telex to Cilangkap...", "Tallying June 7th ballot boxes from the provinces...", "Calibrating IPTN N-250 fly-by-wire telemetry...", "Monitoring student barricades at Semanggi...", "Sweeping Bina Graha telephone lines for Cendana taps...", "Formatting Letters of Intent for the IMF mission...", "Preparing UNAMET security briefings for Dili...", "Counting wavering Golkar delegates in Senayan...", "Drafting the President's Accountability Speech...")
